    "chunk_text": "\u00e6fdnesse gehabban ne m\u00e6gen, & \u00f0a For\u00f0\u00e6m hit is awriten \u00f0\u00e6t hit sie betere \u00f0\u00e6t mon gehiewige \u00f0onne he birne, for\u00f0\u00e6m butan Ac se \u00f0e mare god gehet \u00f0onne he \u00e6r dyde, he gede\u00f0 mid \u00f0\u00e6m \u00f0\u00e6t l\u00e6sse god unaliefed \u00f0\u00e6t he Hit is awrieten on \u00f0\u00e6m godspelle \u00f0\u00e6t nan mon ne scyle don his hond to \u00f0\u00e6re sylg, & hawian Ne \u00f0on ma se \u00f0e gehat geh\u00e6t, ne wene he \u00f0\u00e6t he sie a \u00f0y near hefonrice, gif he hine from went For\u00f0\u00e6m se \u00f0e hine selfne maran godes beh\u00e6t, & \u00f0onne forl\u00e6t \u00f0a maran god, & went hine to \u00f0\u00e6m \u00d0\u00e6tte on o\u00f0re wisan sint to manienne \u00f0a \u00f0e gefandod habba\u00f0 \u00f0ara fl\u00e6sclicra synna, on o\u00f0re On o\u00f0re wisan sint to manienne \u00f0a \u00f0e ongieta\u00f0 & witon hiera lichoman synna, on o\u00f0re \u00f0a \u00f0a \u00f0e \u00d0a sint to manienne \u00f0e hiera lichoman synna onfunden habba\u00f0, \u00f0\u00e6t hie huru \u00e6fter \u00f0\u00e6m \u00d0\u00e6tte \u00f0a \u00f0a \u00f0e mildheortlice bio\u00f0 gehealdne \u00e6fter hiora \u00f0urhtogenum synnum, \u00f0\u00e6tte hi eft For\u00f0\u00e6m is gecweden to \u00f0\u00e6re syngiendan sawle, \u00f0e n\u00e6fre hire synna geswican nyle: \u00f0u h\u00e6fst \u00d0eah hie sint to manienne \u00f0\u00e6t hie geornlice giemen, \u00f0eah hi \u00f0\u00e6t god hira gecynde gehal nolden Him is \u00f0earf \u00f0\u00e6t hie ge\u00f0encen",
